# Zealakit (kit repo)

This repository is the **zealakit scaffolding CLI**, not a generated app.

Before changing structure, recipes, templates, or `src/`:

1. Read [.cursor/skills/zealakit/SKILL.md](../skills/zealakit/SKILL.md)
2. When adding/changing templates or recipes, also read [.cursor/skills/zealakit/extending.md](../skills/zealakit/extending.md)

Hard rules:

- Single source for scopes/categories: `src/constants.ts`
- Register templates/recipes in `src/registry/`
- Recipe `overlays/<id>/` must match `getTemplateOverlayId(template)`
- Do not confuse kit root `.cursor/` (maintainers) with `templates/*` / `recipes/*` `.cursor/` (shipped to apps)
